#MOBILES
#800
cruel apocalypse~
Larsen the Cruel~
Larsen the Cruel
~
Draws his sword and moves to decapitate you.
~
131111 532648 0 S
99 0 0 0d32000+0 0d0+0
0 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog larsen clan apocalypse danger leave recall~
if rand(33)
mpecho $I grunts 'Nobody important is named here. The important ones name themselves, usually right before they kill you.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'No recall, no gate, no mercy. We keep this place tidy in exactly that order.'
else
mpecho $I says 'You can leave the way you came. You probably won't, but you can.'
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog mercy~
if rand(50)
mpecho Larsen the Cruel says 'You found the front door. I admire that. I'll mourn it too, a little.'
else
mpecho Larsen the Cruel says 'Everyone here works for me. Even the part of you that's already deciding to run.'
endif
~
|
